          "author": "",
          "description": "Lyle’s music is rooted in both faith and family. He started learning piano at the age of three and never looked back. Today, he shares gentle, faith-filled instrumentals designed to bring a spirit of hope and stillness into your home. With soothing arrangements of beloved Christian hymns and heartfelt originals, these unspoken prayers are perfect for quiet Sundays, family devotionals, or winding down at bedtime.",
